{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_05",
  "title": "拙山",
  "storyCode": "WR-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0120b4a0713d92fcc08d10ab48aa3f0040d1fe850e43111a9991d6c5050621d6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......那位女性叫什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "沒問過？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "也不敢呐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "再說那如夢似幻，如真似假，興許是一年半載，又或是彈指一瞬，恍神之間，這上哪兒問去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧遊歷炎國，有意無意回想起這個故事，細細想來，興許只是住持爺爺敷衍我而胡亂編的故事罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不過小僧在炎國四處打聽，這幅《拙山盡起圖》竟然還小有名氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "相傳是一位約百年前的無名畫家所留，曾有皇親國戚重金求而不得，因此聞名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "正巧到了灰齊山附近，小僧便突發奇想，想借機去看看是否能找到那畫中的奇景......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "哈哈，在山中尋到一處山清水秀之地，反應過來時，就已經身在此處啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "灰齊山上的那棟茅屋，這倒是和我們如出一轍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......這裡會是一場夢嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "如是一場大夢，那對施主來說，小僧便是夢中幻象，那小僧說的話，也就不可信了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "若是不可信了，炎熔施主又如何判斷眼前的景色，是夢非夢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "慢點......你要把我繞暈了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那你知道怎麼離開這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧雲遊至今，仍未明白如何主動離開此地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......至今？你在這裡待了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "很久很久啦，細細數來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "二位的茶就要涼了，別光顧著說話，品一品茶吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊......謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（呼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......嗯？說起來，黎小姐，難道也是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "只是本地的當鋪掌櫃罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐......我很欣賞你的善良，也很欽佩你從墨魎手下保護鎮民的意願，但有時候，請多考慮一下自己的安危。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那些怪物對羅德島的精銳構不成威脅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "此話不假，炎熔施主一身好本領，無需擔心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......若真是如此，也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，我有一個問題，不知當不當問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "問吧，其實不用對我們這麼拘謹的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，你可端詳過水中的月亮？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "無論水中月色會被粼粼波光扯碎成什麼模樣，待到風平浪靜時，它還會是那輪圓月。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "若是因為憐憫那一時閃爍的水中月色，因此濕了鞋，著了涼，是大沒有必要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，你可會為了撈那一輪水中月......費盡心思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不......應該不會？做這種事沒什麼意義吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎麼突然說這個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......我不知炎熔小姐的那輪明月是何模樣，也就無法提醒炎熔小姐到底差在何處。不過水中月，終歸是水中月罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "沒必要為了我們，做到這個份上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你是說......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人！恩人！你沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......啊呀，連茶都泡了，居然不喊我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "這二位想必也是婆山鎮的貴客吧？我去泡茶，順路拿些糕點，你們慢敘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那位是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是這裡的掌櫃，名字叫黎，黎明的黎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，那些墨魎呢？哦哦，我知道了！一定是恩人神威無敵，把它們全都趕跑啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——那個小女孩安全了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "她安全了，沒事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚，恩人呐，你怎麼如此不信任我......我走過刀山火海也未流淚的，現在倒是有幾分心酸......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "二位，茶水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嗯嗯......聞著就感覺到是很昂貴的茶葉呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人好見識！像我這種凡夫俗子，只覺得苦，完全嘗不出滋味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "只是尋常茶葉罷了。鎮上集市，只有賣這一種茶葉，若是不合意，還請見諒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "呼啊~雖然習慣了紅茶和咖啡，但是偶爾品一品大炎的茶葉，也別有一番滋味嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧家鄉也有堪稱別具滋味的茶葉，若是有機會，請務必讓小僧小露一手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "哎呀，小炎熔，你想睡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "沒有。只是突然放鬆下來罷了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "茶水養心，幾位勞煩的事情，不是靠奔波勞累就能解決的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......還是沒什麼線索啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "在這畫中天地，只能慢慢來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "對了！嵯峨，你見過這個東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧並不知曉......只是不知為何，小僧總覺得曾在某地見過此物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "真的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "待小僧想想......唔......這個紋理......此般材質......究竟是在何時何地見識過呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "茶水反射的光......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "唔哦哦！？發生什麼了？怎麼突然都站起來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "......天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "天亮了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "這、這些東西怎麼靠近這裡的！？這裡可是午時街啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "不、不對，天邊......太陽怎、怎跑到那邊去了？鴻洞山發生了什麼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "啊啊啊！這些東西，在，在吃人——！快跑，快跑啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "......逝者如斯夫，日升月落，理當如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "......擾吾清靜......是她的意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......這、這是什麼情況？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "為什麼太陽會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "——太陽本來就該這樣哦，小炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯？啊，這我當然知道啊，我只是在想怎麼突然恢復正常了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "等等，對啊，這才是正常的......我剛才是怎麼想的......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "二位恩人，我怎麼覺得鎮子那方向，這麼熱鬧呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "救命——救命！救——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你沒事吧！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我、我沒事，原來你們在這兒，真是太好了，太好了！那些怪物突然不怕陽光啦!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "它們正在鎮子上，吃、吃、吃......吃人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
